{"id": "1809602", "name": "מערכת משוואות המיוצגת בעזרת מטריצה מקדמים 3X3 ששיש לה פתרון יחיד", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "random_invertible_matrix", "params": ["n"], "body": "genmatrix (LowerWithDiag1, n, n).transpose(genmatrix (LowerWithDiag1, n, n))"}, {"name": "makeRHSCol", "params": ["m", "rk"], "body": "(v:zeromatrix(m,1), for i thru rk do(v[i][1]:rand_with_prohib(-3,3,[0])),v)"}, {"name": "random_rrechelon_mmatrix", "params": ["m", "n", "min_val", "max_val", "pivots_cols"], "body": "block([row, A, pivots],\n    row:1,\n    pivots: sort(pivots_cols),\n    A:zeromatrix(m,n),\n    for i thru length(pivots) do(\n        piv: pivots[i],\n        A[row][piv]:1,\n        for j:piv+1 thru n do (\n            A[row][j]:rand_with_prohib(min_val,max_val,[])\n            ),\n        row:row+1\n        ),\n     for i thru length(pivots) do(\n        piv: pivots[i],\n        for j:1 thru i-1 do (\n            A[j][piv]:0\n            )\n        ),\n    A)"}, {"name": "eq", "params": ["i"], "body": "(lhs:sum (cofMatrix[i,j]*vars[j],j,1,n),rhs:rshVect[i,1],lhs=rhs)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתבונן במערכת המשוואות הבאות:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\begin{array}{c}{{CT:0}} \\\\ {{CT:1}} \\\\ {{CT:2}} \\end{array}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>האם יש פתרון למערכת?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>במידה וכן, הזינו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_0,w_1,w_2\\)</span> כך שקבוצת הפתרונות היא:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\{v_0 +t\\cdot w_1+s\\cdot w_2 \\: |\\: s,t\\in \\mathbb{R}\\}\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_0=\\) [[input:ans2]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(w_1=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(w_2=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: במידה ויש פתרון יחיד, מזינים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_1,w_2\\)</span> וקטורים של אפסים. באופן דומה, אם אין צורך ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(w_2\\)</span> מזינים בו וקטור של אפסים.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br><br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([0],[0],[0])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correctVecs: false;\nif hasSol=false then correctVecs:true;\nif hasSol=true then if is(equal(A.ans2,b)) and is(zeromatrixp(A.ans3)) and  is(zeromatrixp(A.ans4)) and rank(addcol(ans3,ans4))=nullity then correctVecs:true;\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "hasSol", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correctVecs", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "E", "LowerWithDiag1", "b", "cofMatrix", "hasSol", "m", "n", "nullSpaceBase", "nullity", "piv", "pivots_cols", "rk", "rshVect", "v", "v0", "vars", "w1", "w2"], "nvariants": 50}